---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { company } from '../data/company';
---
<Layout title="Privacy notice"><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</p><h1>Privacy notice.</h1></div></section><section class="section wrap"><article class="prose"><h2>Enquiries</h2><p>When you use the enquiry form, the details you provide—your name, email address, optional phone number, and message—are used to respond to your enquiry.</p><h2>Form processing</h2><p>When enabled, our enquiry form sends your submission to Web3Forms for processing and email delivery. Web3Forms processes this information under its own policy. Please avoid including sensitive personal information in your message.</p><p><a href="https://web3forms.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Web3Forms privacy policy</a></p><h2>Website resources</h2><p>This website uses Google Fonts to display its typefaces. Loading those fonts sends a request to Google. The website does not include advertising or analytics tracking.</p><h2>Questions about your information</h2><p>{company.email ? <>Contact <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a> for questions about information you have shared with us.</> : <>Contact SriNidhi Engineers through the available company contact channels for questions about information you have shared.</>}</p></article></section></Layout>
